    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## CV Screening — Prototype\n\n**One form:** Job Title + JD (pasted) + one-or-more CVs uploaded together.\n\n**Flow:** JD → structured criteria (once) → fan out CVs → OCR (PDF/image) → readability guard → per-criterion verdicts + evidence → deterministic BUCKET → Google Sheet.\n\n**Buckets:** Strong / Possible / Unlikely / NeedsReview.\nThe LLM never picks the bucket — the Compute Bucket code does, so it is reproducible and auditable. A coverage number is kept only for internal sorting, not shown as a headline.\n\n**Before running:**\n1. Set your Gemini, Mistral and Google Sheets credentials on the coloured nodes.\n2. In `Append result to Sheet`, replace the Sheet ID and add these column headers to row 1:\n   Job Title | Source File | Bucket | Reason | Core Met | Core Total | Core Missing | Coverage (internal) | Breakdown JSON\n3. Test with 5–10 known CVs and eyeball the buckets before trusting it.",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 640
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -480,
        -272
      ],
      "id": "a6f72711-7b4d-419d-ac5b-b44bcadc8f67",
      "name": "note_main"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Deliberately deferred (the \"changes later\")\n\n- **DOCX extraction.** Word files currently route to NeedsReview. Add an Extract-From-File / convert step on the false branch of `OCR-able file type?` to read .docx text, then feed it into the same guard → assess path.\n- **Scale / folder-watch.** This is a form for testing. For 300–400 CVs arriving over time, swap the form for a Drive/SharePoint trigger + batching, and extract criteria once per role (store it) instead of per submission.\n- **HR approval gate on criteria.** Production should let HR review/approve the extracted criteria before any CV is judged (legal defensibility).\n- **De-dup / re-run safety** when a real datastore replaces the sheet.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 560
